{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734710",
      "title": "Adding Form Buttons",
      "sourceHash": "a05492a537991a991d7e3a9c28900b02116a963363511d70291aacc0ac5f3cc8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.54,
          "en": "So let's now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.54,
          "end": 5.7,
          "en": "that we actually have a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.7,
          "end": 7.53,
          "en": "where we have a submit button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.53,
          "end": 9.15,
          "en": "and maybe also a cancel button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.15,
          "end": 11.79,
          "en": "to cancel editing and close the modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.79,
          "end": 13.38,
          "en": "but that we have a submit button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.38,
          "end": 15.99,
          "en": "which when pressed adds a new post",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.99,
          "end": 18.21,
          "en": "and our list or our grid of posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.21,
          "end": 21.543,
          "en": "then keeps on growing as we add more posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.07,
          "end": 26.79,
          "en": "To achieve this, back in the new post component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.79,
          "end": 30.39,
          "en": "we first of all have to add some buttons there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.39,
          "end": 32.19,
          "en": "For this, here at the end of the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.19,
          "end": 33.87,
          "en": "we can add a new paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.87,
          "end": 38.55,
          "en": "which should receive a class name of classes-dot-actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.55,
          "end": 41.97,
          "en": "Since I prepared a class named actions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.97,
          "end": 43.92,
          "en": "in the CSS file which then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.92,
          "end": 45.963,
          "en": "will style these buttons accordingly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.28,
          "end": 49.95,
          "en": "Now, in this newly added paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.95,
          "end": 52.053,
          "en": "we should add two buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.25,
          "end": 55.92,
          "en": "Now the second button will have a caption of submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.92,
          "end": 59.043,
          "en": "The first button will have a caption of cancel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.97,
          "end": 63.87,
          "en": "However, by default, if you add buttons to a form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.87,
          "end": 66.78,
          "en": "if they are pressed, they will submit that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.78,
          "end": 69.63,
          "en": "This means that a submit event will be generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.63,
          "end": 73.74,
          "en": "and also that by default the browser will generate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.74,
          "end": 76.53,
          "en": "and send an HTTP request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.53,
          "end": 78.90299999999999,
          "en": "to the server that's serving the website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 80.82,
          "en": "Now we don't want that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.82,
          "end": 82.59,
          "en": "and we'll prevent it therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.59,
          "end": 84.6,
          "en": "because we want to handle the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 86.73,
          "en": "with our client side code instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.73,
          "end": 91.23,
          "en": "with React instead not with server side code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.23,
          "end": 93.6,
          "en": "But besides that, I also want to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.6,
          "end": 96.9,
          "en": "that not both buttons submit the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.9,
          "end": 99.24000000000001,
          "en": "instead only the submit button should do so,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.24000000000001,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "not the cancel button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 103.53,
          "en": "To make sure that the cancel button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.53,
          "end": 105.78,
          "en": "does not trigger form submission,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.78,
          "end": 108.69,
          "en": "we can and should give it a type attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.69,
          "end": 111.36,
          "en": "which we set to button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 111.36,
          "end": 113.19,
          "en": "The alternative which we can set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.19,
          "end": 116.1,
          "en": "on the submit button is type submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.1,
          "end": 119.223,
          "en": "But this is not required since status to default anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.15,
          "end": 122.55,
          "en": "Now this button button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.55,
          "end": 125.82,
          "en": "will now not submit the form when clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.82,
          "end": 127.8,
          "en": "Instead, it should close the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.8,
          "end": 129.33,
          "en": "and to ensure that it does,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.33,
          "end": 132.39,
          "en": "I'll accept a new prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 132.39,
          "end": 134.43,
          "en": "And I'll actually also use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 134.43,
          "end": 136.38,
          "en": "Object Destructuring here to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.38,
          "end": 138.87,
          "en": "get my on-body-change and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138.87,
          "end": 141.54,
          "en": "on-author-change prop so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 141.54,
          "end": 143.57999999999998,
          "en": "that we can get rid of props-dot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 143.57999999999998,
          "end": 145.743,
          "en": "here in these two places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 147.21,
          "end": 150,
          "en": "But I'll now also accept a new prop as mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 150,
          "end": 153.39,
          "en": "which could be named on-cancel. Name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 153.39,
          "end": 156.84,
          "en": "But I do expect to get a function on this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 156.84,
          "end": 160.053,
          "en": "because I want to connect it to the on-click prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.55,
          "end": 163.32,
          "en": "so that in the end, an event listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.32,
          "end": 165.54,
          "en": "is set up triggering the function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 165.54,
          "end": 168.393,
          "en": "which will be received on the on-cancel prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 169.47,
          "end": 173.01,
          "en": "Now this on-cancel prop therefore must be set here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 173.01,
          "end": 175.35,
          "en": "on the new post component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 175.35,
          "end": 177.42000000000002,
          "en": "and it should be set to a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 177.42000000000002,
          "end": 179.043,
          "en": "that will close that modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 180.06,
          "end": 182.85,
          "en": "Now for that we have the on-stop-posting prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 182.85,
          "end": 186,
          "en": "which we're already receiving here on posts-list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 186,
          "end": 188.19,
          "en": "which if you remember, will in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 188.19,
          "end": 191.01,
          "en": "trigger hide-modal-handler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 191.01,
          "end": 193.02,
          "en": "which is exactly what should get triggered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 193.02,
          "end": 196.56,
          "en": "so I can reuse the on-stop-posting prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 196.56,
          "end": 199.53300000000002,
          "en": "and set it as a value for the on-cancel prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 201.3,
          "end": 203.25,
          "en": "So with that, if we save everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 203.25,
          "end": 206.22,
          "en": "and we open our modal, we now got these buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 206.22,
          "end": 209.52,
          "en": "and if I click cancel the modal closes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 209.52,
          "end": 210.51,
          "en": "But now let's make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 210.51,
          "end": 212.643,
          "en": "that we can also submit that form.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}